  "details": "1. Open Broadcast / Photo camera.\n\n2. Move at high speed in an aeroplane or vehicle.\n\nIssue:\n\nIf the camera display is grabbed and moved when travelling at high speed, the display occasionally repositions far behind the player, or clips inside their head, often making it impossible to retrieve. This issue is solved by locking the display.\n\nHowever, if the camera is grabbed when travelling at high speed whilst in 'flight mode', (and the player crashes the moving vehicle) the display again vanishes, leaving the player unable to physically move until they close the camera entirely. \n\nThe new camera system is amazing, but these little bugs make it challenging for streamers and movie makers to show its full potential! :)",
